<title>USA: Norwest unit completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Norwest unit completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Corp's Norwest Bank Minnesota said Thursday it completed its acquisition of National Business Finance Inc, a company in the business of buying accounts receivable at a discount to finance small businesses.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Denver-based National Business becomes a subsidiary of Norwest Bank Minnesota and will be managed by Norwest Business Credit Inc.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
